### mini-EDRMS demo requests (VS Code "REST Client" or JetBrains HTTP Client).
### Start the server first: make run

@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Upload a sample
POST {{base}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=demo

--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="finance_01.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./samples/finance_01.png
--demo--

### List documents (optionally search with ?q=)
GET {{base}}/documents?q=invoice

### Get one document
GET {{base}}/documents/1

### Extract text (Tesseract, or the sidecar .txt if Tesseract is not installed)
POST {{base}}/documents/1/ocr

### File under a category: correspondence | hr | finance | procurement | legal
PUT {{base}}/documents/1/category
Content-Type: application/json

{"category": "finance", "reason": "It is an invoice"}

### Route to a department: registry | human_resources | finance | procurement | legal | director
POST {{base}}/documents/1/route
Content-Type: application/json

{"department": "finance", "reason": "Finance pays invoices"}

### Audit log for one document (omit doc_id for everything)
GET {{base}}/audit?doc_id=1

### Invalid category -> 422 listing allowed values
PUT {{base}}/documents/1/category
Content-Type: application/json

{"category": "sport"}

### Unknown document -> 404
GET {{base}}/documents/9999
